# js/app.js is GENERATED by tools/precompile.cjs from the JSX inside
# golsz-app.html. It is ~900KB across ~3,300 lines, and its longest line is
# over 200,000 characters, so a one-word change renders as a 400KB+ diff that
# git reports as "2 insertions, 2 deletions".
#
# Without this, a reviewer reading history sees an enormous unreadable diff on
# nearly every commit and reasonably concludes the artifact should not be
# committed — which would be the wrong call: it is committed on purpose so the
# browser never compiles JSX, and tests/test_compiled_artifact.cjs pins its sha
# against the source so the two cannot drift.
js/app.js linguist-generated=true -diff
